				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				966,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Extract Command DTOs and service into file-per-struct modules\n\nDecompose the Command RPC module to align with the project-wide PascalCase file-per-struct convention. Create dedicated `Command.rs`, `CommandService.rs`, and `CommandValidation.rs` files within `Source/RPC/Commands`.\n\nThe `Command` struct defines the core DTO for command metadata (id, title, description) and implements `Serialize` and `Deserialize` for Tauri event payloads. `CommandService` establishes a placeholder in-memory registry using `HashMap` to track registered command handlers. `CommandValidation` provides the initial stub for input validation logic.\n\nEach file defines its core type as `Struct` to satisfy Tauri's `generate_handler!` macro symbol resolution requirements, maintaining architectural consistency with recent refactors in Echo, Telemetry, and Configuration modules.",
			"SHA": "0c75e06733f49b2421aff02e083ac4d8a1f3c70a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T05:36:16Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				962,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Extract Configuration DTOs and service into file-per-struct modules\n\nDecompose the new Configuration RPC module to align with the project-wide PascalCase file-per-struct convention. Create dedicated `ConfigurationScope.rs`, `ConfigurationService.rs`, and `ConfigurationUpdate.rs` files within `Source/RPC/Configuration`.\n\nThe `ConfigurationScope` enum defines Global, Workspace, and Folder scopes. `ConfigurationUpdate` acts as the DTO carrying key, value, and scope for configuration changes. `ConfigurationService` implements a placeholder in-memory key-value store using `HashMap<String, Value>` with `get` and `set` methods. All files define their core types as `Struct` or `Enum` to satisfy Tauri's `generate_handler!` macro symbol resolution requirements, mirroring the architectural pattern established in recent Echo, Telemetry, Workspace, and Vine refactors.",
			"SHA": "118c95c7742e8f7cce344f7cb801d3f8d3d245f4"
		}
